  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fostering knowledge exchange and collaborative partnerships in Circular Built Environment sector between the Netherlands and Hong Kong SAR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project promotes Dutch expertise in sustainable construction and circular economy through the application of the CIRCO methodology. It supports knowledge exchange and capacity building through training sessions, workshops, masterclasses, and inspiration visits in selected key cities.The approach combines strengthened policy dialogue with local authorities, the introduction of best practices and proven methodologies, and the facilitation of partnerships between Dutch companies and Chinese stakeholders. The initiative contributes to positioning the Netherlands as a strategic partner in advancing urban sustainability objectives in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
